e_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Example 14.2, p. 390; scan 398"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c\\}\\)</span> 为三个互异字符的字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\{S,T,A,B,C\\}\">\\(V=\\{S,T,A,B,C\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|V|=5\">\\(|V|=5\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\">\\(V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\{f,g\\}\">\\(I=\\{f,g\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\ne g\">\\(f\\ne g\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\notin I\">\\(\\varepsilon\\notin I\\)</span>。指标文法语义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"683388600cf59838\" href=\"?note=683388600cf59838\" title=\"73-df-indexed-language\">73-df-indexed-language</a>；非 CFL 的泵引理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c8c56808857d2df\" href=\"?note=5c8c56808857d2df\" title=\"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound\">73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}equal\\text{-}three\\text{-}blocks}\\vdash\nP_0\\coloneqq\\{(T,ABC)\\},\\quad P_+\\coloneqq\\{(S,T,g),(T,T,f)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}equal\\text{-}three\\text{-}blocks}\\vdash\nP_0\\coloneqq\\{(T,ABC)\\},\\quad P_+\\coloneqq\\{(S,T,g),(T,T,f)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}equal\\text{-}three\\text{-}blocks}\\vdash\nP_-\\coloneqq\\{(A,f,aA),(A,g,\\langle a\\rangle),(B,f,bB),(B,g,\\langle b\\rangle),(C,f,cC),(C,g,\\langle c\\rangle)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}equal\\text{-}three\\text{-}blocks}\\vdash\nP_-\\coloneqq\\{(A,f,aA),(A,g,\\langle a\\rangle),(B,f,bB),(B,g,\\langle b\\rangle),(C,f,cC),(C,g,\\langle c\\rangle)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}equal\\text{-}three\\text{-}blocks}\\vdash\nG_{abc}\\coloneqq(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}equal\\text{-}three\\text{-}blocks}\\vdash\nG_{abc}\\coloneqq(V,\\Sigma,I,(P_0,P_+,P_-),S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}equal\\text{-}three\\text{-}blocks}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{IG}_{\\Sigma}(G_{abc})\\land L_{\\mathsf{IG}}(G_{abc})=\\{a^nb^nc^n:n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}\\land L_{\\mathsf{IG}}(G_{abc})\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}indexed\\text{-}equal\\text{-}three\\text{-}blocks}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{IG}_{\\Sigma}(G_{abc})\\land L_{\\mathsf{IG}}(G_{abc})=\\{a^nb^nc^n:n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}\\land L_{\\mathsf{IG}}(G_{abc})\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>S 先压 g，T 可压任意多个 f，然后普通规则复制整条 f…fg 栈给 A、B、C。各分支每弹 f 输出一个字符，弹底部 g 再输出一个，所以三个块长度相同且为正。原书 Example 14.2 的全部规则已按三分量接口转写。非 CFL 由泵段长度上界使其无法同时覆盖三个块并保持等长得到。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-indexed-language","status":"resolved","id":"683388600cf59838","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-indexed-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound","status":"resolved","id":"5c8c56808857d2df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-indexed-language","status":"resolved","id":"683388600cf59838","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c\\}$ 为三个互异字符的字母表，$V=\\{S,T,A,B,C\\}$，$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)$、$|V|=5$ 且 $V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing$；$I=\\{f,g\\}$，$f\\ne g$，$\\varepsilon\\notin I$。指标文法语义见 [[73-df-indexed-language]]；非 CFL 的泵引理见 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound","status":"resolved","id":"5c8c56808857d2df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c\\}$ 为三个互异字符的字母表，$V=\\{S,T,A,B,C\\}$，$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)$、$|V|=5$ 且 $V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing$；$I=\\{f,g\\}$，$f\\ne g$，$\\varepsilon\\notin I$。指标文法语义见 [[73-df-indexed-language]]；非 CFL 的泵引理见 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\{S,T,A,B,C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)","display":false},{"tex":"|V|=5","display":false},{"tex":"V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing","display":false},{"t